---
// 林奈层级，画成层层嵌套的盒子。第一周用来给整门课立参照点。
//
// The Linnaean hierarchy, drawn as nested boxes. Week 1 uses it as the
// reference point the rest of the course is measured against.
//
// Nesting is the claim being illustrated — each rank sits inside the last —
// so the drawing nests actual elements rather than stacking a picture of
// nesting. Every label is real HTML text, which means it is selectable,
// resizable, contrast-checked by axe, and read by a screen reader. Baked-in
// raster text is none of those, and SVG <text> comes back `incomplete` from
// axe in Chrome, which this repo does not count as a pass.
//
// 颜色跟 CreatureCut 一条路：边框 currentColor，没有十六进制，没有 opacity。
// Dark mode is handled by not handling it: the border is `currentColor`, so it
// follows the theme's text colour in both schemes from one set of rules. No
// `opacity` anywhere — in this repo it multiplies against tokens that already
// carry alpha and has failed axe in Chrome.
//
// Measured contrast against the page background, hand-checked in Chrome because
// axe returns `incomplete` for every text node on this page and incomplete is
// not a pass (2026-09-18):
//   .rank__taxon      18.9px  17.88:1   needs 4.5
//   .rank__character  16.2px   8.92:1   needs 4.5
//   .rank__rank       14.4px   8.92:1   needs 4.5  ← the smallest text here
// The 8.92 figure is `--at-text-secondary`, which is the body colour at 78%
// alpha. It clears normal-text contrast on its own; it is the extra `opacity`
// on top of it that has failed before, so there is none.
//
// The diagnostic characters are written here rather than copied from a textbook
// figure: the common one has Chordata as "animals with a backbone", which is
// Vertebrata, and a course about the rigour of characters cannot print that.
interface Rank {
  /** The rank's name in the hierarchy. */
  rank: string;
  /** The taxon a human belongs to at this rank. */
  taxon: string;
  /** A character that admits a member to this rank. */
  character: string;
}

const RANKS: Rank[] = [
  { rank: "Kingdom", taxon: "Animalia", character: "multicellular, and feeds on other organisms" },
  { rank: "Phylum", taxon: "Chordata", character: "has a notochord at some stage of life" },
  { rank: "Class", taxon: "Mammalia", character: "mammary glands, and hair" },
  { rank: "Order", taxon: "Primates", character: "grasping hands, forward-facing eyes" },
  { rank: "Family", taxon: "Hominidae", character: "no tail, and a broad shallow ribcage" },
  { rank: "Genus", taxon: "Homo", character: "upright gait, and a large braincase" },
  { rank: "Species", taxon: "sapiens", character: "high forehead, thin skull bones" },
];

interface Props {
  /** How many ranks to draw, counting from Kingdom. Defaults to all seven. */
  depth?: number;
}

const { depth = RANKS.length } = Astro.props;
const shown = RANKS.slice(0, depth);

// 从最内层往外包，所以渲染时不需要递归组件。
// Wrapped from the innermost rank outwards, so no recursive component is
// needed: the reduce builds the nesting as a list of ranks still to open.
---

<figure class="hierarchy">
  <div class="hierarchy__stack">
    {
      // 只用一层 map 是不够的，嵌套要靠嵌套元素，所以这里手写七层的开合。
      shown.reduceRight(
        (inner, level, index) => (
          <div class="rank" style={`--rank-depth: ${index}`}>
            <p class="rank__head">
              <span class="rank__rank">{level.rank}</span>
              <i class="rank__taxon">{level.taxon}</i>
            </p>
            <p class="rank__character">{level.character}</p>
            {inner}
          </div>
        ),
        null as unknown as astroHTML.JSX.Element,
      )
    }
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    The seven ranks Linnaeus nested, with the taxon a human is admitted to at each
    and one character that admits them. <i>Homo sapiens</i> is the innermost box:
    every rank outside it is a claim that also holds.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .hierarchy {
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  .rank {
    padding: 0.7rem 0.85rem;
    border: 1px solid currentColor;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  /* 内层之间留一点气口，最内层不留。 */
  .rank .rank {
    margin-top: 0.7rem;
  }

  .rank__head {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .rank__rank {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--at-text-secondary);
  }

  .rank__taxon {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }

  .rank__character {
    margin: 0.15rem 0 0;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--at-text-secondary);
  }

  .hierarchy figcaption {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--at-text-secondary);
  }

  /* 手机上七层嵌套的左右内距会把最内层挤没，所以收窄。 */
  @media (max-width: 34rem) {
    .rank {
      padding: 0.55rem 0.5rem;
    }

    .rank .rank {
      margin-top: 0.55rem;
    }
  }
</style>
